{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A number place (Sudoku) puzzle with cute cats that beginners can enjoy. There are 100 puzzles of different difficulty levels, totaling 900 puzzles. With the back move function and hint function, you can challenge yourself to solve difficult puzzle. The cute cat illustration changes pose every time you write a number, giving you a sense of relaxation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game can be played with a mouse, keyboard, or gamepad.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3875440?t=1752872398","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3875440?t=1752872398","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875440/dc9b9f76d1027bfeae7219f765b8c8841af7fdde/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752872398","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875440/dc9b9f76d1027bfeae7219f765b8c8841af7fdde/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752872398","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A number place (Sudoku) puzzle with cute cats that beginners can enjoy. There are 100 puzzles of different difficulty levels, totaling 900 puzzles. With the back move function and hint function, you can challenge yourself to solve difficult puzzle. The cute cat illustration changes pose every time you write a number, giving you a sense of relaxation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game can be played with a mouse, keyboard, or gamepad.</p>","developers":["Arkhamsoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875440/e691398d5a150c800a109299a24813d7542e7457/header.jpg?t=1752872398","is_free":false,